               PERFORM REFRESH-POSTCODE-0011.
               PERFORM FORMAT-HOUSE-TYPE-0012.
               PERFORM EXPAND-MODEL-0013.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0014.
               PERFORM DERIVE-VALUE-0015.
               PERFORM REFRESH-WITH-PROFITS-0016.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-STATUS-CODE-0017.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-MODEL-0018.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-EQUITIES-0019.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-NCD-YEARS-0020.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0021.
