       SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0007.
               EXEC CICS SEND MAP('ZVAMAP0I')
                         MAPSET('ZVAMAP05')
                         ERASE
                         RESP(WS-RESP)
               END-EXEC.
               EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('ZVAMAP0I')
                         MAPSET('ZVAMAP05')
                         RESP(WS-RESP)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       EXPAND-MANAGED-FUND-0008.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
